stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> StartupHook
  StartupHook --> SharedCorners: setup_lighting / create_lighting
  SharedCorners --> OverlaySweeps: create corners with deferred activity
  OverlaySweeps --> CompatibilitySweep: excluded or dynamic sites
  CompatibilitySweep --> ActiveCorners: deferred activation + reconciliation
  ActiveCorners --> RuntimeQueues: barrier released
  SharedCorners --> FailedStartup: exception
  OverlaySweeps --> FailedStartup: exception
  CompatibilitySweep --> FailedStartup: exception
  FailedStartup --> [*]: readiness flags false; exception rethrown
  RuntimeQueues --> SourceWork: sources process
  SourceWork --> CornerChanges: contributions updated
  CornerChanges --> OverlayWork: queued overlay changes
  OverlayWork --> RuntimeQueues
  RuntimeQueues --> RestoredDaylight: saved round import
  RestoredDaylight --> RuntimeQueues: apply_restored_lighting
  note right of SharedCorners
    Shared identity matters across neighboring turfs.
    Source mutation can yield; startup barrier is not optional.
  end note
